<table width=100% border=0 cellpadding=4 cellspacing=0><tr><td width=5>　</td><td width=100% valign=top><font color="000080"><br>West Namedから拾ってます。<br>心当たりのある方はLottoで。<br><br>Tear of the Rainmaker<br>MAGIC ITEM  LORE ITEM  <br>Slot: EAR  <br>AC: 7<br>STR: +5  DEX: +5  AGI: +5  HP: +80  <br>MANA: +30  SV FIRE: +6  SV DISEASE: +6  SV COLD: +6  <br>SV MAGIC: +6  SV POISON: +6<br>Recommended level of 56.<br>WT:  0.2    Size: TINY<br>Class: WAR PAL RNG SHD MNK BRD ROG BST <br>Race: ALL<br><br>締め切りは2/5(水)23:59まで</font></td><td nowrap valign=top>
 <font color=#FF0000>[01] Sinsyoku：74</font><br>
 <font color=#FF0000>[01] tankkobu：62</font><br>
 <font color=#FF0000>[01] Kunimitsu：49</font><br>
 <font color=#FF0000>[01] Tiala：7</font><br>
 <font color=#FF0000>[01] Kous：7</font><br>
</font></td></tr></table>
<P><hr width=95% size=1>
